{"body_markdown":"","change_reason":"基础召回专项已实施并验证；保留原讨论版本及未解决的高层问题。","content_hash":"8413437560cfa8d94a5f839437478dbc545cf4f326730bc8b139f0feb06a2b24","created_at":"2026-09-11T22:22:07.944793Z","created_by":{"id":"Codex","kind":"ai"},"discovery":"owner_only","keywords":["经验检索","上下文组织","方案比较","召回"],"kind":"document_section","level":null,"owner_id":"RES-AI-EXPERIENCE-CONTEXT","payload":{"blocks":[{"evidence_refs":[{"locator":"正文","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"d99e2e8e4a9eecfe054f85063f8483d0bdfef6a08446bc49179f08f90d5e079e","target_id":"MEM-c592fbff-3e36-5df5-ba99-c84dfc88c01b","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"正文","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"144b7945366e9a4c56826252ee5635fdae71dbf4f001934158abe26a1f796e73","target_id":"MEM-5db92dcc-78f9-58b3-afd6-18a44d18b80a","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"正文","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"6d34b8b391148377f49498f693779076a89419dcc0420fca2709b9422f9594d9","target_id":"MEM-0fa8c730-f337-5248-a492-0daf13bd340a","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"正文","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"492e4352fbabbe56ca1302e0c802d19eb287ef2da97ea21dee8e5ec7097fdcde","target_id":"MEM-c72f2043-42b5-5c09-b6cf-8831a99a884d","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"正文","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"2aa021df8d038142cc5cd5a285bfd700ce0fafa0f43b1464b706680035f65b3f","target_id":"MEM-8a459c83-cdeb-51e4-8fc1-f23e551f4f1a","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"正文","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"bcc1dee9665d7faebe7be31ffb06534bf0f5bc531320ab730454864e06d27199","target_id":"MEM-d6d0985a-0ac4-5686-a839-569cb47bcbd5","target_kind":"record"}],"markdown":"## 当前状态\n\nv0.1方案比较继续；本轮已补齐基础正文发现、材料查询本地语义通道及规范记录候选窗口。默认词法保持兼容，dense可显式启用，使用原384维离线模型。高层独立跨层调度、生成背景、语料扩词和跨轮上下文尚未选型。\n\n## 为何先补基础\n\n旧版正文独有词实际漏检，增加命中后的阅读深度不能解决未进入候选的问题。已补L1稳定块FTS/向量投影，命中保留固定修订、哈希和块定位；展开补齐必要定义。按规范记录去重及限窗，避免多表示挤占候选。水位、权限、版本和预算失败明确降级。\n\n## 验证与限制\n\n最终81项定向回归、18项真实setup.cmd扩展旧工作区升级/恢复通过；较早189项memory范围有1项既存B01冻结指纹失败，没有宣称全回归通过。四题英文查询中文合成材料中词法召回0/4、混合首位4/4正确；每题Top-3精确率仅1/3，仍需展开判断。该次小型查询为156–188ms、一次15–19输入token；不能推广到真实业务或大库。另有实际AI公开检索和两条完整正文阅读自查。用户人工、第二物理机及大库验收未做。\n\n## 保留的方案原则\n\n索引前补背景改善发现；命中后Small2Big补必要语境；接口负责交付真实展开内容。多层独立召回可以增加覆盖，未必降低总工作量；先合并去重再展开，分别比较等待、阅读成本和解决质量。当前块标题背景是确定性投影，并未实现AI生成背景。\n\n## 下一步\n\n用同一真实题集比较有界全文、A/B基线与多层/技术块路线，再逐项评估查询反馈、背景和重排。关系或全局问题有明确缺口时再试图方法。基础专项已解决，最终路线、停止判据和跨轮恢复仍需证据。","type":"prose"}],"missing_refs":[],"role":"introduction","section_key":"brief","title":"经验检索方案v0.2：基础已补齐与研究边界","watch_refs":[]},"previous_revision":1,"provenance_gap":null,"record_hash":"aadcf0ee52ba7654f4e3993c87d9b5e356dc46f207f2c700caab675f3fe04bf9","record_id":"MEM-753db91f-ddc3-5d34-b2e3-5dd0411b9b35","record_reason":"保存本轮讨论依据、候选比较与选择理由，支持后续研究回顾。","revision":2,"schema_version":3,"sensitivity":"internal","sources":[{"locator":"正文","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"d99e2e8e4a9eecfe054f85063f8483d0bdfef6a08446bc49179f08f90d5e079e","target_id":"MEM-c592fbff-3e36-5df5-ba99-c84dfc88c01b","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"正文","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"144b7945366e9a4c56826252ee5635fdae71dbf4f001934158abe26a1f796e73","target_id":"MEM-5db92dcc-78f9-58b3-afd6-18a44d18b80a","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"正文","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"6d34b8b391148377f49498f693779076a89419dcc0420fca2709b9422f9594d9","target_id":"MEM-0fa8c730-f337-5248-a492-0daf13bd340a","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"正文","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"492e4352fbabbe56ca1302e0c802d19eb287ef2da97ea21dee8e5ec7097fdcde","target_id":"MEM-c72f2043-42b5-5c09-b6cf-8831a99a884d","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"正文","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"2aa021df8d038142cc5cd5a285bfd700ce0fafa0f43b1464b706680035f65b3f","target_id":"MEM-8a459c83-cdeb-51e4-8fc1-f23e551f4f1a","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"正文","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"bcc1dee9665d7faebe7be31ffb06534bf0f5bc531320ab730454864e06d27199","target_id":"